+    for maintenance/out of consumables -- see ProductionMachine.
+    available's own comment), tie-broken by whichever has the fewest
+    jobs currently active on it (machine_workload's active_job_count) --
+    an even spread across the fleet beats always defaulting to
+    whichever machine happens to sort first alphabetically.
