+    Returns None if no compatible+available machine exists at all (e.g.
+    every machine for this capability is down, or capability_id is
+    genuinely unmatched by any machine) -- callers should treat that as
+    "leave machine_id unset, let a person sort it out" rather than a
+    hard error; a job can still be created without a machine assigned.
